<heading><![CDATA[<B>Reptiles</B>]]></heading>

<text><![CDATA[Reptiles are cold-blooded animals. Most reptiles lay eggs and their skin is covered with hard, dry scales. ]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[Reptiles breathe through their lungs.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[Except snakes, all reptiles have external ear openings.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[Dinosaurs were also reptiles.]]></text>

